    "content": "## I.LPRA — Report A \"Jobs by Milestone Date\" (RTP/Actual → Net Sales) (thin transport ONLY)\n\nGmail → POST raw PDF bytes → LP-MCP. ZERO parsing here — all parse/validate/write logic lives in LP-MCP `src/jobs/lp-report-ingest.js` (fail-closed). LP schedules this email ~6:00 ET daily.\n\n**Inbox CONFIRMED (2026-08-04):** LP schedules to `lp-reports@reecewindowsmail.com` — the `q` filter is scoped to it. Sender + subject PARTIALLY VERIFIED: the first real email (2026-08-04) matched this filter and reached LP-MCP (it was rejected there for wrong report parameters — LP schedule must be Milestone=RTP, Mode=Actual, month range). Pin the filter against the first correctly-scheduled email, then activate. Non-matching emails simply stay in the inbox.\n\nA 200 with success:false = deterministic rejection (bad PDF) — do NOT retry; it's logged in scorecard_ingest_log + GroupMe. 5xx = transport error — node retries 3x."
